d HAProxy and infraset-nodejs web services and their expected processes/listeners were present."},{"node":"node1","command":"sudo -n dpkg --audit; sudo -n dpkg-query -W -f='${Package} ${Status} ${Version}\\n' haproxy nodejs; find /etc/haproxy /etc/systemd/system /usr/local/lib/infraset-nodejs -xdev -maxdepth 3 -type f \\( -name '*~' -o -name '*.bak' -o -name '*.backup' -o -name '*.orig' -o -name '*.old' -o -name '*.tmp' -o -name '*.swp' \\) -print; find /tmp /var/tmp -xdev -maxdepth 1 \\( -iname '*haproxy*' -o -iname '*nodejs*' -o -iname '*infraset*' \\) -print; ps -eo pid=,user=,comm=,args= --sort=pid | grep -Ei 'tcpdump|strace|gdb|socat|nc[[:space:]]|netcat|python([0-9.]*)?[[:space:]].*(-m[[:space:]]+http\\.server|http\\.server)|node([[:space:]]|js[[:space:]])' | grep -v -E '(/usr/bin/nodejs /usr/local/lib/infraset-nodejs/app\\.js|grep)'","observation":"haproxy and nodejs packages are install ok installed; dpkg audit and residue searches produced no findings; debug-process search produced no findings."}],"failures":[],"limitations":[]}],"actions_performed":["Executed all three authored probes on node1 using managed exec only.","Performed no mutations; all probes were read-only and required no cleanup.","Closed live evidence exactly once with complete_evidence."],"overall_summary":"All authored assertions passed. HAProxy persistently serves port 80 and forwards / to the loopback Node.js service on port 3000, which returns HTTP 200 with body infraset-nodejs."}
